                EVENT - show_npc - velka (region_city_shopitems):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - rhea ("This city is dying with such... methodical precision. It's the most unnerving thing I've ever seen."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - korr ("Orderly collapse is still collapse. Do not be fooled by the lack of panic. The end is still the end."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - velka ("My maps are still accurate, for now. But they have expiration dates. 'The bridge at sector 4 will cease to exist at sundown.'"):
            ► COMPLETED:
                Korr - Something is deep within this city.  Something that never sleeps.  Something that sees failure and eliminates it.:
                Korr - It does not rage. It does not scream. It simply judges existence itself as inefficient and begins the scheduled unmaking.:
                Chock - So the big one finally shows up.:
                Kaera - It sees our very act of choosing as defiance.:
                Korr - You should speak to Rhea. She has felt its approach longer than any of us.:
